        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Just picked up the finishing touch for our tire machine restoration. Thanks Pierre for the excellent quality and service!",
        "time": 1733357543,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Eric Dutton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114017604780230195776/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVolVb7T8jVjiciteaQGsqvWe8ltOsdzKt9XNkARpU2zwrXL1Rr=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "8 months ago",
        "text": "Peter has been lettering my trucks for years now.  The service is amazing!!  I used to have other companies letter my trucks and with in a few years they would begin to peal off.  I have a truck that Lucky Stripe did going on 8 years now, not one sticker has pealed or dulled in color.  He uses only the best products and is so meticulous at the installation\nThank you",
        "time": 1748872964,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "A P",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111985933487082113657/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLV9hEuCFOqKjMRGmeOyMc4DjMMCyhmHvHUvaqi4ogN6UtJ8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Fast, professional and friendly service. Their work is top quality. I went to see them with a rough idea for my product labels and the end result was more than I ever expected. I highly recommended this place.",
        "time": 1682607462,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Cezary Maciocha",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110072519064867264140/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIauNbE_rbTnn5K9hBL0B_5cJ5yFw7HRouVNo-maBZICwTz2Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Lucky Stripe has been supplying our rally club with racing numbers and various stickers for several years now.\n\nPerfect quality, great prices, amazing service!\n\nNo drama, no surprises, always on time!",
        "time": 1683065988,
        "translated": false
      },
